Installation Instructions
*************************

EMANE is now built using Rust and Cargo. The legacy GNU Autotools (`configure` / `make`) build system has been removed.

Basic Installation
==================

1. Ensure you have the Rust toolchain installed (e.g., via `rustup`).
2. Run the following command from the root of the repository to build the workspace:

   cargo build --release

3. To install the binaries (like `emane`, `emaneinfo`, etc.), run:

   cargo install --path rust/emane-core

Developing and Testing
======================

To run the test suite across the workspace:

   cargo test --workspace

For more information, please consult the EMANE Wiki or the Rust/Cargo documentation.
